==Battleground==
*4 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~6.67 seconds<sup>20f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 0.67~4 seconds<sup>20f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 1.33~4 seconds<sup>40f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 33.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,400f</sup>.
*6 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn after 52 seconds<sup>1,560f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Samurai Doggy]] spawns as the boss after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you are struggling with the One Horns, bring units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] or [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] to kill them quickly. One Horns drop a ton of money, so max out your wallet. To kill the [[Samurai Doggy]], use ranged units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] to kill it.

